00:01:20.872 --> 00:01:25.243
♪South Mountain Hunters
on the righteous path♪

00:01:26.752 --> 00:01:37.024
♪South Mountain Hunters
on the righteous path♪

00:01:37.024 --> 00:01:41.216
=Love on the Turquoise Land=

00:01:41.216 --> 00:01:44.000
(This story is a work of fiction)

00:01:44.080 --> 00:01:46.928
=Episode 10=

00:01:47.024 --> 00:01:54.130
(Xicang, Shiqing)

00:02:07.920 --> 00:02:09.959
Nie Jiuluo, wake up!

00:02:10.200 --> 00:02:11.200
Don't pass out.

00:02:17.760 --> 00:02:18.359
Luo.

00:02:21.160 --> 00:02:21.839
Luo.

00:02:24.440 --> 00:02:25.160
Luo.

00:02:28.280 --> 00:02:29.359
Wake up.

00:02:30.000 --> 00:02:30.959
We're almost there.

00:02:31.399 --> 00:02:32.040
Luo.

00:02:32.359 --> 00:02:33.000
Mom.

00:02:34.880 --> 00:02:36.399
Where are we going?

00:02:38.160 --> 00:02:39.519
I promised you

00:02:40.079 --> 00:02:41.119
a boat ride.

00:02:42.920 --> 00:02:43.880
Forget about it?

00:02:58.839 --> 00:02:59.799
I won't go.

00:03:04.559 --> 00:03:05.519
Nie Jiuluo.

00:03:05.920 --> 00:03:06.880
Nie Jiuluo.

00:03:08.880 --> 00:03:09.839
I won't go.

00:03:12.720 --> 00:03:13.679
You're finally awake.

00:03:33.600 --> 00:03:34.440
Let me help you.

00:03:35.839 --> 00:03:36.920
I can manage.

00:03:51.440 --> 00:03:52.119
Almost there.

00:03:52.119 --> 00:03:53.600
Wait for me. Just a moment.

00:04:01.720 --> 00:04:02.600
What? You scared me.

00:04:02.600 --> 00:04:03.600
Stop it. Get the door.

00:04:05.959 --> 00:04:07.119
The clinic is not yours.

00:04:10.959 --> 00:04:12.000
Bro, what's wrong?

00:04:12.880 --> 00:04:13.559
Move!

00:04:18.119 --> 00:04:19.280
Let's go.

00:04:20.879 --> 00:04:22.119
T-To the operating room.

00:04:36.480 --> 00:04:37.280
A penetrating wound.

00:04:39.199 --> 00:04:40.319
Lie down first.

00:04:40.520 --> 00:04:41.808
I'll prepare for sterilization.

00:04:42.640 --> 00:04:43.559
Don't just stand there.

00:04:44.679 --> 00:04:45.559
Cut the clothes open.

00:04:46.480 --> 00:04:47.199
Wait, I...

00:04:55.080 --> 00:04:56.520
Well, I...

00:06:25.080 --> 00:06:25.720
Get out.

00:06:53.920 --> 00:06:54.520
How is it?

00:06:54.640 --> 00:06:55.439
Got no clues.

00:06:56.759 --> 00:06:57.999
Did Mad Blade contact you?

00:07:00.920 --> 00:07:01.640
Go on searching?

00:07:05.439 --> 00:07:06.080
Retreat.

00:07:43.888 --> 00:07:46.832
(Herb)

00:08:06.160 --> 00:08:07.040
She's stable for now.

00:08:23.879 --> 00:08:25.400
If you're trying to poison her,

00:08:25.480 --> 00:08:27.239
my surgery would be pointless.

00:08:32.199 --> 00:08:32.760
Thanks.

00:08:44.880 --> 00:08:47.240
H-How long have we known each other?

00:08:47.640 --> 00:08:49.920
Wanbao Tower didn't even exist
when we met.

00:08:50.240 --> 00:08:52.079
Now it's becoming a century-old shop.

00:08:52.079 --> 00:08:53.000
So?

00:08:53.599 --> 00:08:55.000
So, we're buddies.

00:08:55.160 --> 00:08:55.959
Right?

00:08:59.199 --> 00:09:00.880
Ms. Lin has been

00:09:00.880 --> 00:09:03.240
more than a mother to us both.

00:09:03.319 --> 00:09:05.360
We never swore brotherhood,

00:09:05.520 --> 00:09:06.799
but we are kind

00:09:06.799 --> 00:09:08.120
of best buddies.

00:09:11.240 --> 00:09:11.839
Fine.

00:09:13.079 --> 00:09:14.640
You helped me today,

00:09:15.160 --> 00:09:16.120
and I owe you this.

00:09:17.160 --> 00:09:17.959
But

00:09:19.799 --> 00:09:21.199
if you leak a word,

00:09:23.599 --> 00:09:25.400
especially to Ms. Lin,

00:09:25.799 --> 00:09:27.799
you'll be out of Xicang.

00:09:27.799 --> 00:09:28.599
Believe me?

00:09:34.160 --> 00:09:34.839
Tuo.

00:09:35.959 --> 00:09:38.520
You wouldn't come to me
unless desperate.

00:09:39.679 --> 00:09:41.040
Stop the threats.

00:09:41.439 --> 00:09:43.040
If you don't trust me, take her away.

00:09:43.160 --> 00:09:44.319
I won't leak a word.

00:09:53.360 --> 00:09:54.040
Thanks.

00:09:54.360 --> 00:09:55.439
Alright, enough.

00:09:55.439 --> 00:09:57.160
Stop it. Get me a bowl.

00:09:58.240 --> 00:09:59.839
I'll test for poison.

00:10:04.599 --> 00:10:06.400
What did you put in?

00:10:06.520 --> 00:10:08.599
Not worried about incompatibility?

00:10:35.240 --> 00:10:36.120
Big Head, Shan Qiang.

00:10:36.559 --> 00:10:37.920
Take a team each tomorrow

00:10:38.280 --> 00:10:40.120
(Clues Map)
to find Chen Fu and Han Guan.

00:10:40.839 --> 00:10:43.360
Said to find Jiang, yet found nothing.

00:10:43.360 --> 00:10:44.240
A lot of nonsense.

00:10:44.240 --> 00:10:46.520
Double-check vehicle info later.

00:10:47.339 --> 00:10:47.839
Got it.

00:10:47.839 --> 00:10:49.920
Even support Mad Blade
hunting Earth Fiends.

00:10:50.079 --> 00:10:52.040
Found no Fiends,
yet Mad Blade's missing.

00:10:52.040 --> 00:10:54.120
Humanoid Earth Fiends have no scent,

00:10:55.280 --> 00:10:57.199
but put three Hounds in each team,

00:10:57.520 --> 00:10:58.479
just in case.

00:10:59.360 --> 00:11:00.679
The Hounds are sharp.

00:11:01.319 --> 00:11:02.799
They bark without smelling anything.

00:11:07.199 --> 00:11:08.120
Rest up.

00:11:08.599 --> 00:11:09.760
Assemble at 6 AM.

00:11:11.959 --> 00:11:12.640
Alright.

00:11:13.079 --> 00:11:13.760
Bedtime.

00:11:18.040 --> 00:11:19.400
Exhausted.

00:11:24.079 --> 00:11:25.240
If not for Jiang,

00:11:25.799 --> 00:11:27.000
we wouldn't be alive.

00:11:27.799 --> 00:11:28.719
Everything we're doing

00:11:28.719 --> 00:11:29.959
is for Jiang.

00:11:31.319 --> 00:11:32.719
I want to find Jiang too.

00:11:32.719 --> 00:11:34.160
But where is he anyway?

00:11:34.160 --> 00:11:34.880
What do Han Guan

00:11:34.880 --> 00:11:36.280
and Chen Fu have to do with me?

00:11:36.920 --> 00:11:38.839
You're not the only one
thinking this way now.

00:11:39.880 --> 00:11:41.520
But internal conflicts solve nothing.

00:11:42.040 --> 00:11:43.640
We need someone to lead now.

00:11:43.640 --> 00:11:45.719
Better than being in a mess,
no matter how you deny.

00:11:46.719 --> 00:11:48.760
Fine, my mistake.

00:11:59.696 --> 00:12:05.200
(Clue Map)

00:12:06.599 --> 00:12:07.400
Sorry,

00:12:07.760 --> 00:12:10.400
the subscriber you dialed
is unavailable.

00:12:10.920 --> 00:12:12.240
Please try again later.

00:13:53.000 --> 00:13:54.400
I already brushed my teeth.

00:15:28.839 --> 00:15:30.479
Stop pushing yourself. Go take a nap.

00:15:31.959 --> 00:15:32.719
It's fine.

00:15:33.160 --> 00:15:34.120
Don't worry about me.

00:15:35.040 --> 00:15:36.439
I'm not worried about you, okay?

00:15:37.439 --> 00:15:39.240
Having one critical patient exhausts me.

00:15:39.599 --> 00:15:41.439
If you collapse here from exhaustion,

00:15:41.640 --> 00:15:43.079
how can I keep this clinic running?

00:15:43.199 --> 00:15:44.479
I'm just worried about myself.

00:15:47.640 --> 00:15:48.679
When will she wake up?

00:15:50.000 --> 00:15:51.120
No idea.

00:15:52.479 --> 00:15:54.160
Don't you see her severe injure?

00:15:55.760 --> 00:15:56.880
But luckily,

00:15:57.240 --> 00:15:58.559
it's not fatal

00:15:58.799 --> 00:16:00.240
and no vital organs were damaged.

00:16:01.760 --> 00:16:02.439
Tuo.

00:16:03.479 --> 00:16:04.559
What's her background?

00:16:05.040 --> 00:16:06.559
She's slim,

00:16:06.679 --> 00:16:08.120
but her wounds heal freakishly fast.

00:16:08.439 --> 00:16:09.880
Can't believe it.

00:16:10.319 --> 00:16:12.040
She's like the Wolverine.

00:16:16.280 --> 00:16:16.920
You're awake.

00:16:18.439 --> 00:16:19.959
How are those two Earth Fiends?

00:16:20.839 --> 00:16:21.479
What?

00:16:22.240 --> 00:16:23.240
W-What Fiends?

00:16:24.959 --> 00:16:25.760
Filets.

00:16:25.839 --> 00:16:26.920
She meant filets.

00:16:27.000 --> 00:16:27.959
Probably hungry.

00:16:27.959 --> 00:16:29.040
I'll go reheat the congee.

00:16:29.040 --> 00:16:30.120
Wait. Hold on.

00:16:32.599 --> 00:16:33.880
I'm being honest.

00:16:34.040 --> 00:16:34.920
Don't stay here.

00:16:36.559 --> 00:16:37.880
Xiong Hei could show up anytime.

00:16:37.880 --> 00:16:39.199
What to explain if we get caught?

00:16:40.640 --> 00:16:42.319
And, this is my only bed.

00:16:42.479 --> 00:16:43.360
Do you expect me

00:16:43.360 --> 00:16:44.719
to sleep on the operating table?

00:16:48.520 --> 00:16:50.719
Find her a proper recovery spot.

00:16:51.880 --> 00:16:53.199
I've tended her wound

00:16:53.319 --> 00:16:54.400
and got her tetanus shot.

00:16:54.520 --> 00:16:55.719
Just help her change dressing.

00:16:58.760 --> 00:17:00.880
Got it. Thanks.

00:17:02.559 --> 00:17:04.080
She's awake. You stay with her.

00:17:04.239 --> 00:17:05.039
I'll get the congee.

00:17:07.080 --> 00:17:07.800
Thanks.

00:17:22.400 --> 00:17:22.999
Don't worry.

00:17:23.560 --> 00:17:24.784
I'll handle the Earth Fiends.

00:17:27.719 --> 00:17:28.759
How are you feeling now?

00:19:12.560 --> 00:19:13.959
Careful. Here.

00:19:21.600 --> 00:19:22.479
Are you sure

00:19:23.279 --> 00:19:25.600
you can clean up the mess alone?

00:19:27.800 --> 00:19:29.039
Your injuries need attention.

00:19:29.600 --> 00:19:30.640
I'll go handle it later.

00:19:31.999 --> 00:19:32.920
Go now.

00:19:32.920 --> 00:19:33.880
Can't delay any longer.

00:19:34.679 --> 00:19:35.999
I'll take you home first.

00:19:35.999 --> 00:19:36.999
You need proper care.

00:19:38.039 --> 00:19:38.719
I...

00:19:43.959 --> 00:19:44.800
I don't want Ms. Lu

00:19:44.800 --> 00:19:46.360
to see me like this.

00:19:50.679 --> 00:19:51.400
Then what?

00:20:01.239 --> 00:20:02.199
Want some dumplings?

00:20:06.256 --> 00:20:09.616
(Changxi Dumplings)

00:20:13.679 --> 00:20:14.544
(Dumplings)
Mr. Changxi.

00:20:15.479 --> 00:20:16.120
Mr. Changxi.

00:20:16.519 --> 00:20:17.160
Coming.

00:20:19.039 --> 00:20:20.800
This is the man I mentioned

00:20:20.800 --> 00:20:22.199
on the way here.

00:20:22.360 --> 00:20:24.120
He's a good man, great cook,

00:20:24.199 --> 00:20:26.519
old but vigorous,
and best at cooking dumplings.

00:20:26.519 --> 00:20:27.239
Mr. Changxi.

00:20:28.160 --> 00:20:29.320
Don't trust his nonsense.

00:20:29.920 --> 00:20:30.840
Miss Nie, right?

00:20:31.439 --> 00:20:32.519
Come on, hurry up.

00:20:33.039 --> 00:20:34.120
Dumplings get cold.

00:20:34.400 --> 00:20:36.239
Mr. Changxi, sorry for bothering you.

00:20:36.840 --> 00:20:37.999
Don't mention it.

00:20:39.120 --> 00:20:40.719
Tuo said you're unwell.

00:20:41.199 --> 00:20:43.999
These fillings are light,
nutritious, and easy to digest.

00:20:44.239 --> 00:20:44.920
Try some.

00:20:45.479 --> 00:20:47.039
Wipe your hands.

00:20:58.920 --> 00:20:59.840
Here. Clean now.

00:21:03.679 --> 00:21:05.320
You are so caring.

00:21:06.120 --> 00:21:07.920
What a wonder.

00:21:09.640 --> 00:21:10.759
Eat up.

00:21:12.719 --> 00:21:13.439
Thank you.

00:21:13.439 --> 00:21:14.199
No problem.

00:21:16.120 --> 00:21:16.719
Eat up.

00:21:22.672 --> 00:21:23.952
(Open)

00:21:23.952 --> 00:21:26.096
(Closed)

00:21:30.959 --> 00:21:32.759
Don't you like the food?

00:21:34.320 --> 00:21:36.080
No, it's delicious.

00:21:39.519 --> 00:21:40.600
Still feeling unwell?

00:21:41.320 --> 00:21:42.560
I'll get you some broth.

00:21:42.959 --> 00:21:43.560
No need.

00:21:43.560 --> 00:21:44.679
Just get some rest.

00:21:45.279 --> 00:21:46.920
Eating and sleeping
are the best medicine.

00:21:47.880 --> 00:21:49.800
The room's ready.
You can stay in my room.

00:21:50.479 --> 00:21:51.199
What about you?

00:21:51.600 --> 00:21:52.679
I'll take the back room.

00:21:52.679 --> 00:21:53.959
Think I'd sleep on the streets?

00:21:57.160 --> 00:21:57.880
Want more?

00:21:59.640 --> 00:22:00.959
Go take her to her room.

00:22:01.840 --> 00:22:02.360
Okay.

00:22:20.479 --> 00:22:21.400
Take a look around.

00:22:21.679 --> 00:22:23.160
Let me know if you need anything.

00:22:23.400 --> 00:22:24.080
Thank you.

00:22:27.439 --> 00:22:28.080
Thanks a lot.

00:22:37.600 --> 00:22:39.239
Sit down and rest.

00:22:39.600 --> 00:22:41.120
This isn't the time to rest.

00:22:43.239 --> 00:22:45.439
Don't worry. I'll handle those two.

00:22:46.239 --> 00:22:47.320
We can't use

00:22:48.279 --> 00:22:49.600
them to get Jiang back.

00:22:49.679 --> 00:22:50.840
It'll only provoke Lin Xirou.

00:22:51.959 --> 00:22:53.600
Eliminate them as soon as possible.

00:22:54.239 --> 00:22:55.519
Got it. Leave it to me.

00:22:55.880 --> 00:22:56.999
I'll also try

00:22:56.999 --> 00:22:58.080
to get news about Jiang.

00:22:58.199 --> 00:22:58.719
Sit down.

00:23:00.039 --> 00:23:00.539
Careful.

00:23:10.120 --> 00:23:11.679
I've been away too long.

00:23:11.759 --> 00:23:13.320
I need to show my face to Lin Xirou.

00:23:13.840 --> 00:23:15.199
You need proper care.

00:23:16.160 --> 00:23:17.160
Mr. Changxi

00:23:17.400 --> 00:23:18.600
watched me grow up.

00:23:18.600 --> 00:23:19.959
He's practically a father to me.

00:23:20.199 --> 00:23:20.959
You can trust him.

00:23:35.199 --> 00:23:36.320
Rest up.

00:23:51.400 --> 00:23:52.239
Sent it.

00:23:52.239 --> 00:23:53.039
Did you get it?

00:23:53.759 --> 00:23:57.080
Codonopsis, astragalus, pseudoginseng,

00:23:57.719 --> 00:23:58.519
and pigeon?

00:23:58.560 --> 00:23:59.120
Right.

00:23:59.320 --> 00:24:00.959
Where am I supposed to catch a pigeon?

00:24:02.279 --> 00:24:03.800
Get one in the morning market.

00:24:03.959 --> 00:24:05.120
Herbal shops open early.

00:24:05.120 --> 00:24:06.160
The herbs are easy to get.

00:24:06.160 --> 00:24:06.880
I checked it up.

00:24:07.239 --> 00:24:09.424
It is helpful for replenishing
blood after an injury.

00:24:10.120 --> 00:24:10.920
Thank you a lot.

00:24:11.080 --> 00:24:13.120
Best if Miss Nie can drink this soup

00:24:13.439 --> 00:24:14.400
once she wakes tomorrow.

00:24:15.239 --> 00:24:16.600
Replenishing blood?

00:24:18.759 --> 00:24:21.360
Tuo, did she go through a cesarean?

00:24:21.479 --> 00:24:22.959
What?

00:24:22.959 --> 00:24:23.880
Not at all.

00:24:24.759 --> 00:24:26.320
She just got an injury.

00:24:27.840 --> 00:24:29.920
Tuo, be honest with me.

00:24:30.439 --> 00:24:31.640
Where did you find this girl?

00:24:32.640 --> 00:24:33.640
Why is she injured?

00:24:36.039 --> 00:24:37.439
I promised your parents.

00:24:37.840 --> 00:24:39.600
I won't let you stray
down the wrong path.

00:24:40.360 --> 00:24:41.800
Don't get fooled.

00:24:42.120 --> 00:24:44.479
I understand. Don't worry.

00:24:45.920 --> 00:24:47.400
Miss Nie is trustworthy.

00:24:47.920 --> 00:24:49.080
She matters a lot to me.

00:24:49.360 --> 00:24:50.560
But I have urgent matters

00:24:50.560 --> 00:24:51.400
to attend to.

00:24:52.239 --> 00:24:54.199
And you're the person I trust most.

00:24:54.279 --> 00:24:55.239
Please take good care

00:24:55.679 --> 00:24:56.999
of her for me.

00:24:57.199 --> 00:24:57.759
When I return,

00:24:57.759 --> 00:24:58.999
I'll explain everything to you.

00:24:58.999 --> 00:24:59.600
Okay?

00:25:04.560 --> 00:25:05.120
I'm leaving.

00:25:05.600 --> 00:25:06.199
Hold on.

00:25:09.640 --> 00:25:10.800
If her injury

00:25:11.039 --> 00:25:12.519
is related to you,

00:25:13.479 --> 00:25:14.959
you have to take full responsibility.

00:25:17.600 --> 00:25:18.239
Understood.

00:28:00.624 --> 00:28:02.160
(Changxi Dumplings)

00:28:02.160 --> 00:28:03.239
Is the room acceptable?

00:28:04.880 --> 00:28:06.360
Sorry, it's a modest room.

00:28:06.640 --> 00:28:09.039
Not at all, Mr. Changxi.

00:28:09.199 --> 00:28:10.719
I should thank you.

00:28:13.360 --> 00:28:14.519
This is the new phone

00:28:14.759 --> 00:28:16.479
Tuo got for me recently.

00:28:16.800 --> 00:28:17.759
Please take it for now.

00:28:19.360 --> 00:28:21.800
Here's the landline number downstairs.

00:28:22.160 --> 00:28:23.759
Call me if you need something.

00:28:25.400 --> 00:28:26.880
That's unnecessary, Mr. Changxi.

00:28:27.080 --> 00:28:28.279
I'll be fine alone.

00:28:32.120 --> 00:28:34.719
Tuo doesn't ask me for favors often.

00:28:35.279 --> 00:28:37.120
He told me repeatedly

00:28:37.360 --> 00:28:38.640
to take good care of you.

00:28:39.679 --> 00:28:41.080
I can't let him down.

00:28:47.400 --> 00:28:48.039
Alright.

00:28:49.880 --> 00:28:52.039
Well, if he ever treats you badly,

00:28:52.120 --> 00:28:52.920
just tell me.

00:28:53.039 --> 00:28:53.759
I'll lecture him.

00:28:56.360 --> 00:28:58.039
Mr. Changxi, you've misunderstood.

00:28:58.400 --> 00:29:00.080
We are not in a relationship.

00:29:02.120 --> 00:29:02.880
No?

00:29:04.120 --> 00:29:05.199
Anyway,

00:29:05.840 --> 00:29:06.920
I can still lecture him.

00:29:08.800 --> 00:29:09.959
Thanks then.

00:29:10.519 --> 00:29:11.199
No problem.

00:29:12.999 --> 00:29:13.920
I-I'll take my leave.

00:29:34.576 --> 00:29:41.392
(Yuhan Shipyard, Shihe County, Xicang)

00:29:53.080 --> 00:29:53.759
Sorry,

00:29:54.279 --> 00:29:56.920
the subscriber you dialed
is unavailable.

00:29:56.920 --> 00:29:57.800
Please try again...

00:31:06.999 --> 00:31:07.679
You...

00:31:08.719 --> 00:31:09.360
You...

00:31:11.199 --> 00:31:14.920
Y-You're Ms. Lin's son?

00:31:15.360 --> 00:31:16.600
Why would you...

00:31:24.439 --> 00:31:26.239
Tell Mad Blade

00:31:27.840 --> 00:31:29.600
she failed to kill me,

00:31:31.199 --> 00:31:33.080
and she won't live much longer either.

00:31:36.600 --> 00:31:37.959
South Mountain Hunters

00:31:39.239 --> 00:31:40.920
won't survive long.

00:31:55.320 --> 00:31:56.080
She is

00:31:58.519 --> 00:31:59.279
Mad Blade?

00:35:59.680 --> 00:36:00.400
Come in.

00:36:04.079 --> 00:36:06.256
The pigeon soup stewed
with astragalus and codonopsis.

00:36:06.400 --> 00:36:07.536
I skimmed off the grease,

00:36:08.240 --> 00:36:09.360
so it's not greasy at all.

00:36:09.360 --> 00:36:10.039
Have it.

00:36:11.559 --> 00:36:12.680
Thank you, Mr. Changxi.

00:36:12.680 --> 00:36:14.159
You're so considerate.

00:36:14.360 --> 00:36:16.159
Tuo told me to do so.

00:36:16.639 --> 00:36:17.840
I'm an expert at dumplings,

00:36:17.959 --> 00:36:19.119
but this is not my expertise.

00:36:19.280 --> 00:36:20.479
Thank him then.

00:36:22.680 --> 00:36:23.880
Dumplings are available.

00:36:24.039 --> 00:36:24.760
If you get hungry,

00:36:25.039 --> 00:36:26.400
you can always get fresh ones.

00:36:27.760 --> 00:36:29.439
You can go with your work. Thanks.

00:36:30.559 --> 00:36:31.760
Nothing. Drink it.

00:37:01.800 --> 00:37:04.159
(Lin Ling's Health Report)
The liver, kidneys, thyroid,

00:37:04.240 --> 00:37:05.159
including gynecology,

00:37:05.240 --> 00:37:06.800
all indicators are good

00:37:07.039 --> 00:37:08.119
and above standards.

00:37:08.800 --> 00:37:11.840
Her current age and physical condition

00:37:12.360 --> 00:37:13.519
are perfect.

00:37:16.528 --> 00:37:19.176
(Yan Tuo)

00:38:06.920 --> 00:38:07.800
Why so nervous?

00:38:09.360 --> 00:38:10.039
Nothing.

00:38:25.360 --> 00:38:26.959
When the season of flowers has passed,

00:38:26.959 --> 00:38:28.400
not even a bud remains,

00:38:28.519 --> 00:38:29.680
which is the greatest pity.

00:38:31.280 --> 00:38:32.800
Flower appreciation

00:38:32.800 --> 00:38:34.800
must follow nature's timetable.

00:38:35.920 --> 00:38:38.519
Though flowers may bloom again,

00:38:38.760 --> 00:38:40.320
youth never returns.

00:38:41.639 --> 00:38:44.680
People of each age should
fulfill the tasks they have.

00:38:47.519 --> 00:38:49.479
Have dinner with Lv Xian this weekend.

00:38:58.320 --> 00:38:59.680
I-I don't want to go.

00:39:04.159 --> 00:39:04.920
I said

00:39:08.280 --> 00:39:09.360
I don't want to go.

00:39:16.920 --> 00:39:18.200
Compared to peers his age,

00:39:18.959 --> 00:39:21.639
Lv Xian is nice in any aspect.

00:39:22.360 --> 00:39:23.280
For someone like you,

00:39:23.280 --> 00:39:25.559
he's an excellent choice.

00:39:32.519 --> 00:39:34.079
Self-awareness is a virtue.

00:39:34.519 --> 00:39:35.479
For someone like you,

00:39:35.519 --> 00:39:37.360
you don't have much room to be picky.

00:39:38.039 --> 00:39:39.079
Why do you always make me

00:39:39.079 --> 00:39:40.240
do things I hate?

00:39:42.200 --> 00:39:43.159
All these years,

00:39:44.400 --> 00:39:46.959
have you ever cared what I like to eat,

00:39:47.200 --> 00:39:48.240
who I fancy,

00:39:48.280 --> 00:39:50.240
or what life I want to live?

00:39:51.519 --> 00:39:53.079
Are you truly doing this for me,

00:39:53.079 --> 00:39:54.920
or just tormenting me?

00:40:10.800 --> 00:40:12.320
What should you say to me?

00:40:16.240 --> 00:40:16.840
I'm sorry.

00:40:17.159 --> 00:40:17.880
Say it.

00:40:29.800 --> 00:40:31.360
I'm sorry, Ms. Lin.

00:40:55.720 --> 00:40:56.519
Sis will tell you

00:40:56.519 --> 00:40:57.800
the dinner location.

00:41:04.360 --> 00:41:04.999
Ms. Lin.

00:41:07.760 --> 00:41:08.840
You're finally back.

00:41:09.720 --> 00:41:10.599
Logistics department

00:41:10.599 --> 00:41:11.959
said customs seized some medicine.

00:41:12.079 --> 00:41:13.680
It's urgent. We scrambled for help.

00:41:13.999 --> 00:41:14.639
And now?

00:41:15.599 --> 00:41:16.880
All resolved. Don't worry.

00:41:21.519 --> 00:41:22.200
Had a quarrel?

00:41:26.599 --> 00:41:28.360
Don't fret. I'll talk sense into her.

00:41:53.680 --> 00:41:54.760
Ms. Lin.

00:41:55.320 --> 00:41:57.079
My dear Ms. Lin.

00:41:57.800 --> 00:41:59.400
Have you behaved lately?

00:41:59.840 --> 00:42:01.079
Been behaving properly.

00:42:03.800 --> 00:42:04.439
Ms. Lin.

00:42:05.720 --> 00:42:07.119
You're here, and I'm relieved.

00:42:17.880 --> 00:42:18.479
Yueying.

00:42:21.720 --> 00:42:22.559
All these years,

00:42:23.999 --> 00:42:25.920
you haven't changed a bit.

00:42:39.959 --> 00:42:40.840
You might as well

00:42:40.840 --> 00:42:42.360
stay longer.

00:42:42.720 --> 00:42:43.880
Let me help you recuperate.

00:42:49.320 --> 00:42:50.400
Thank you, Ms. Lin.

00:42:54.320 --> 00:42:55.632
Where are Han Guan and Chen Fu?

00:42:57.039 --> 00:42:59.240
Probably still dawdling on the way.

00:42:59.519 --> 00:43:00.599
You're

00:43:00.840 --> 00:43:01.959
the dawdling one.

00:43:02.599 --> 00:43:03.479
Yueying and I

00:43:03.479 --> 00:43:04.999
had waited for you for long.

00:43:05.880 --> 00:43:07.039
I can't hear you!

00:43:07.039 --> 00:43:08.639
Blah blah blah!

00:43:12.800 --> 00:43:14.599
Where's Xiong Hei? Why isn't he here?

00:43:18.559 --> 00:43:19.559
Gou Ya escaped.

00:43:19.840 --> 00:43:21.559
Xiong Hei took people to search for him.

00:43:22.439 --> 00:43:23.119
He escaped?

00:43:35.920 --> 00:43:44.568
♪Your past shines brightly,
your path ahead wide and open♪

00:43:44.688 --> 00:43:52.240
♪My future shines with starlight,
awaiting rhythm's embrace♪

00:43:53.072 --> 00:43:56.976
(Lobby Entrance)

00:43:56.976 --> 00:43:57.880
If you

00:43:58.640 --> 00:43:59.960
don't mind,

00:44:00.400 --> 00:44:01.160
please leave.

00:44:02.000 --> 00:44:02.680
Why?

00:44:04.280 --> 00:44:05.960
If you don't leave,

00:44:06.000 --> 00:44:07.160
I'll have to call the police.

00:44:07.760 --> 00:44:09.280
We're waiting here for someone.

00:44:10.240 --> 00:44:11.480
Did we break the law?

00:44:11.560 --> 00:44:12.120
Exactly.

00:44:13.040 --> 00:44:14.760
You two didn't break the law.

00:44:15.240 --> 00:44:17.600
But your armed friends

00:44:18.000 --> 00:44:20.920
staying at the hotel's back exit

00:44:21.160 --> 00:44:22.280
might break the law.

00:44:26.128 --> 00:44:30.448
♪Heaven-forged fire
lights up the endless night♪

00:44:30.512 --> 00:44:34.712
♪Ripping apart the hidden truth
beneath the surface♪

00:44:34.712 --> 00:44:39.072
♪Heaven-sent tides can't
drown this stubborn flame♪

00:44:39.144 --> 00:44:46.912
♪Farewell to the old times,
and scenes fade away one by one♪

00:45:06.432 --> 00:45:10.792
♪The shapeless fire
clings to matter to illuminate♪

00:45:10.792 --> 00:45:15.112
♪Yet malice in darkness
defies the flame's pursuit♪

00:45:15.112 --> 00:45:19.552
♪A noble name must do righteous deeds♪

00:45:19.552 --> 00:45:21.992
♪After sunrise,
even wise words falter in truth♪

00:45:21.992 --> 00:45:26.072
♪Heaven-forged fire
scorches flesh and bone♪

00:45:26.072 --> 00:45:30.432
♪Dig out the truth buried
beneath the earth♪

00:45:30.432 --> 00:45:34.792
♪Heaven-sent tides can't
quench this reckless fire♪

00:45:34.792 --> 00:45:39.152
♪If we don't retreat,
we'll go through it together♪

00:45:39.152 --> 00:45:43.512
♪Heaven-kindled flames are different♪

00:45:43.512 --> 00:45:47.792
♪Truth's madness is hiding
under the surface♪

00:45:47.792 --> 00:45:52.352
♪The large waves are rolling
towards the sky♪

00:45:52.352 --> 00:46:00.072
♪Farewell to the old times,
and scenes fade away one by one♪